  "post_title": "Segunda sesión ‘El Mercado de Onda cocina para tí’ con Julio Segura",
  "post_date": "2016-05-05 07:52:49",
  "post_name": "segunda-sesion-%e2%80%98el-mercado-de-onda-cocina-para-ti%e2%80%99-con-julio-segarra",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Economía|Noticias|Política",
  "post_content": "<p>(31 fotos) Julio Segura, chef del restaurante El M&oacute;n de Julio, ha protagonizado este mi&eacute;rcoles la segunda sesi&oacute;n de <em>El Mercado de Onda cocina para t&iacute;</em>, dentro del plan de dinamizaci&oacute;n que el Ayuntamiento ha encargado a la C&aacute;mara de Comercio de Castell&oacute;n, con la colaboraci&oacute;n de la Asociaci&oacute;n de Hosteler&iacute;a y Turismo HOSTURIONDA.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/05/IMG_4010.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Despu&eacute;s de comprar todos los productos en varias paradas, Segura cocin&oacute; en directo un original arroz al horno utilizando como cazuela una calabaza.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/05/IMG_4018.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La pr&oacute;xima actividad del plan de dinamizaci&oacute;n ser&aacute; el viernes 20 de mayo. Con el lema El Mercat d&#39;Onda se viste de largo, todas las paradas sorprender&aacute;n por su elegancia y presentaci&oacute;n.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/platmesmaigmercatonda/img_4006.jpg\" alt=\"img_4006\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/platmesmaigmercatonda/img_4007.jpg\" alt=\"img_4007\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/platmesmaigmercatonda/img_4008.jpg\" alt=\"img_4008\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/platmesmaigmercatonda/img_4009.jpg\" alt=\"img_4009\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/platmesmaigmercatonda/img_4010.jpg\" alt=\"img_4010\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/platmesmaigmercatonda/img_4011.jpg\" alt=\"img_4011\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/platmesmaigmercatonda/img_4012.jpg\" alt=\"img_4012\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/platmesmaigmercatonda/img_4013.jpg\" alt=\"img_4013\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/platmesmaigmercatonda/img_4014.jpg\" alt=\"img_4014\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/platmesmaigmercatonda/img_4015.jpg\" alt=\"img_4015\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/platmesmaigmercatonda/img_4016.jpg\" alt=\"img_4016\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/platmesmaigmercatonda/img_4017.jpg\" alt=\"img_4017\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/platmesmaigmercatonda/img_4018.jpg\" alt=\"img_4018\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/platmesmaigmercatonda/img_4019.jpg\" alt=\"img_4019\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/platmesmaigmercatonda/img_4021.jpg\" alt=\"img_4021\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/platmesmaigmercatonda/img_4022.jpg\" alt=\"img_4022\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/platmesmaigmercatonda/img_4023.jpg\" alt=\"img_4023\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/platmesmaigmercatonda/img_4024.jpg\" alt=\"img_4024\" styl